		data-flex-basis=&#34;323px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;尝试f12查看源码，结果给封了&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://xxchen-yu.github.io/p/qingcen%E9%9D%B6%E5%9C%BAweb%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8wp/IMG/4.png&#34;
	width=&#34;338&#34;
	height=&#34;778&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://xxchen-yu.github.io/p/qingcen%E9%9D%B6%E5%9C%BAweb%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8wp/IMG/4_hu_c184764186453586.png 480w, https://xxchen-yu.github.io/p/qingcen%E9%9D%B6%E5%9C%BAweb%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8wp/IMG/4_hu_6b42f8c6134f7c64.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;43&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;104px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;shift+ctrl+i打开开发者工具或者右上角的更多工具&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://xxchen-yu.github.io/p/qingcen%E9%9D%B6%E5%9C%BAweb%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8wp/IMG/5.png&#34;
	width=&#34;600&#34;
	height=&#34;257&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://xxchen-yu.github.io/p/qingcen%E9%9D%B6%E5%9C%BAweb%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8wp/IMG/5_hu_f68fdda6484b7e4c.png 480w, https://xxchen-yu.github.io/p/qingcen%E9%9D%B6%E5%9C%BAweb%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8wp/IMG/5_hu_6615d7526ac356cb.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;233&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;560px&#34;
	
&gt;
发现flag&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;basic_2&#34;&gt;BASIC_2
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;打开网页发现只有“提交反馈”和“返回官网”能够交互“返回官网”内没有有效信息，查看源码也没有发现有用内容&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://xxchen-yu.github.io/p/qingcen%E9%9D%B6%E5%9C%BAweb%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8wp/IMG/6.png&#34;
	width=&#34;1146&#34;
	height=&#34;879&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://xxchen-yu.github.io/p/qingcen%E9%9D%B6%E5%9C%BAweb%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8wp/IMG/6_hu_b748dd4f5ef7e278.png 480w, https://xxchen-yu.github.io/p/qingcen%E9%9D%B6%E5%9C%BAweb%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8wp/IMG/6_hu_f41956625a73857a.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;130&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;312px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;使用抓包工具抓取提交反馈的请求，发现请求体中有个is_admin=0&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://xxchen-yu.github.io/p/qingcen%E9%9D%B6%E5%9C%BAweb%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8wp/IMG/7.png&#34;
	width=&#34;750&#34;
	height=&#34;466&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://xxchen-yu.github.io/p/qingcen%E9%9D%B6%E5%9C%BAweb%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8wp/IMG/7_hu_8fad55730ed81cb9.png 480w, https://xxchen-yu.github.io/p/qingcen%E9%9D%B6%E5%9C%BAweb%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8wp/IMG/7_hu_28fa26d15e442414.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;160&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;386px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;尝试修改is_admin=1，进行发包，返回flag&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://xxchen-yu.github.io/p/qingcen%E9%9D%B6%E5%9C%BAweb%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8wp/IMG/8.png&#34;
